{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03832","headline":"奉和御制璟与张说源乾曜同日上官命宴都堂赐诗应制 · 宋璟","name":"奉和御制璟与张说源乾曜同日上官命宴都堂赐诗应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丞相邦之重，非贤谅不居。\n老臣慵且惫，何德以当诸。\n厚秩先爲忝，崇班复此除。\n太常陈礼乐，中掖降簪裾。\n圣酒山河润，仙文象纬舒。\n冒恩怀宠锡，陈力省空虚。\n郭隗慙无骏，冯谖媿有鱼。\n不知周勃者，荣幸定何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋璟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}